<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>TLE493D-W2B6-A1 on 如是有为</title><link>https://sensor.fans/models/tle493d-w2b6-a1/</link><description>Recent content in TLE493D-W2B6-A1 on 如是有为</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://sensor.fans/models/tle493d-w2b6-a1/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>摇杆没动，游戏人物却自己走了：磁摇杆的坑，比想象中深</title><link>https://sensor.fans/posts/wechat-a3qplfftpyz7gs3mmrqpyg/</link><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://sensor.fans/posts/wechat-a3qplfftpyz7gs3mmrqpyg/</guid><description>&lt;p>玩游戏最烦的一件事，是明明没有碰摇杆，屏幕上的人物却开始慢慢移动。有人把这种现象统称为“摇杆漂移”。于是，磁摇杆出现了：它不再依靠传统电位器的滑动接触来测位置，而用磁铁和磁传感器实现非接触检测。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>